QuestGuidance.Register("en",169,{
[5377]="7003049C\n1\tDefeat crebain near Cracabor (total: 10)\tThe hill of Cracabor is the highest point in the Wold and is located just north of Twickenburg.\n2\tReturn to Tidlac, Sergeant of Twickenburg\tSergeant Tidlac is keeping watch on the road from the fort of Twickenburg, between Harwick and Floodwend.\n",
[5378]="7003046D\n1\tExplore the top of Cracabor\tThe hill of Cracabor is the highest point in the Wold, located just south of Wódscrafen, and north of Twickenburg. You should climb Cracabor and scout its height.\n2\tReturn to Tidlac, Sergeant of Twickenburg\tSergeant Tidlac is keeping watch on the road from the fort of Twickenburg, between Harwick and Floodwend. You should speak with Sergeant Tidlac of what you found.\n",
[5379]="70066A6E\n1\tCollect flood-iron (total: 6)\030Defeat wood-trolls (total: 8)\tAlêtifa has charged you with gathering ore and thinning the number of wood-trolls blocking the way to the nearby waterfall. Wood-trolls and ore can be found in north-western Pinnath Gelin.\n2\tReturn to Alêtifa\tYou should let Alêtifa know that you have cleared some of the wood-trolls out of the area and bring her the ore you gathered. Alêtifa is waiting by the banks of the Hathollant, in north-western Pinnath Gelin.\n",
[5380]="7003FE5F\n1\tDefeat the snipers (total: 4)\tThe snipers must be defeated so the assault on the docks can be victorious.\n",
[5381]="70031062\n1\tHelp Radwig defend the Mead Hall\tThe town of Floodwend is besieged by the forces of Jóshkhin Orda, led by the Grim Southron who re-grouped the routed army. You must protect the Mead Hall, and the young Thane of Floodwend!\n2\tSpeak with Thane Radwig\tThe Mead Hall was saved in the assault on Floodwend, but the town has taken its losses. The enemy has been routed! But will they return?\n",
[5382]="70048C9F\n1\tInvestigate thorny vine\030Investigate spewing mushroom\030Investigate bleeding sapling\030Investigate weeping reed\030Investigate pungent flower\tMany new plant species can be found in southern Agarnaith. You should investigate these plants.\n2\tCompleted\tCompleted.\n",
[5383]="70057ECF\n1\tFind the florist's daughter\tThe florist's daughter was sent to the First Circle of Minas Tirith to gather flowers. You should look for the florist's daughter.\n2\tCollect summer blossoms (total: 10)\tFlowers can be found in the gardens and green spaces of the First Circle of Minas Tirith. You should collect flowers for the florist's daughter.\n3\tReturn to the florist's daughter\tThe florist's daughter can be found on the First Circle of Minas Tirith. You should bring the flowers to the florist's daughter.\n4\tCraft the floral crowns (quantity: see journal)\tThe florist's daughter's blanket is on the First Circle of Minas Tirith. Assemble the flowers into crowns on the blanket.\n5\tReturn to the florist\tThe florist is on the Seventh Circle of Minas Tirith. Bring the floral crowns to the florist.\n",
[5384]="70057E1D\n1\tGather foul flowers from Vinca's basket\tGather some foul flowers from Vinca's basket. Vinca wants you to \"decorate\" a couple of tables around the Party Tree with her flowers.\n2\tCarry the flowers to the tables (total: 2)\tVinca is targeting two tables around the Party Tree, specifically the ones with empty vases. You should place your flowers in the vases while avoiding Caltha's helpers. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tReport back to Vinca\tThe tables now have bouquets of smelly flowers thanks to your efforts. Vinca will want to hear about your deed.\n",
[5385]="7006EB7E\n1\tGather flowers for Eshtali's tomb (total: 3)\tGather flowers outside Kûr Anzar for Mizâdi's husband, Eshtali. You can find these flowers growing in the hills outside the back gate to the tower of Kûr Anzar.\n2\tBring the flowers to Mizâdi near the tower of Kûr Anzar\tBring the flowers to Mizâdi near the tower of Kûr Anzar.\n3\tSpeak with Mizâdi when you are ready to leave\tSpeak with Mizâdi when you are ready to leave.\n4\tSpeak with Mizâdi near the tower of Kûr Anzar\tSpeak with Mizâdi near the tower of Kûr Anzar.\n",
[5386]="7002C611\n1\tCollect flowers for a keepsake (total: 9)\tGold-and-white flowers grow throughout the northern parts of Thinglad. You should collect flowers for Wynmar to have as a keepsake, to remind him of fair Noriel.\n2\tBring the flowers to Wynmar\tWynmar is at his camp in Thinglad, soon to depart. You should bring the lovely flowers you gathered to Wynmar before he leaves Thinglad for good.\n",
[5387]="7005CBD8\n1\tTalk to Thyfli\tThyfli is located in a camp north of Bazanmanar. Golodhril has asked you to bring a bundle of healing plants to Thyfli.\n",
[5388]="70041384\n1\tStanding in the small patch of sweet-smelling flowers, you feel refreshed and, for a moment, at peace. Could there be other such blossoms here in the Marsh? Search for other patches of the flowers in the Dead Marshes.\t\n2\tCompleted\tYou have discovered all the flower blossoms in the Dead Marshes.\n",
[5389]="7006C6EE\n1\tCollect marsh lilies from the river-banks in Ambarûl ([see journal]/12)\030Collect a relic vase from Eshadûr\030Defeat Ordâkhai bandits at Eshadûr ([see journal]/12)\tRaphûz asked you to make your way along the dry river-bed searching for marsh lilies. He also asked you to collect a vase taken by Ordâkhai bandits at Eshadûr to the north and west.\n2\tDeliver the lilies and vase to Raphûz at Wrackwade\tRaphûz awaits your return at Wrackwade with the vase, lilies, and news of the bandits' defeat. Return to him at the southern outpost of Ambarûl.\n",
[5390]="7000003B\n1\tBring craban-feathers to Arinora\030Collect craban-feathers (total: 8)\tThorn-talon and Sharp-eye crebain can be found on and around Weathertop, in the Lone-lands. In an effort to see to all the work before her, Arinora asked you to collect craban-feathers to help her stuff the pillows of The Forsaken Inn.\n",
[5391]="70008877\n1\tReturn to Quartermaster Apsduf at Tol Ascarnen\030Collect Thistledown-hides (total: 10)\tThistledown aurochs can be found throughout the Ettenmoors. Quartermaster Apsduf sent you into the wild to collect the hides of the mighty Thistledown aurochs. Their hides will be made into flags for Angmar's army.\n",
[5392]="700461B8\n1\tKite-flying locations can be found throughout Hobbiton encircling the Party Tree. They are atop the Hill, near the Appledores, on the river-front south of the Grange, on the hill with a camp-fire to the east of the Party Tree, and in the meadow to the east of Bag End. You should fly each of the summer-themed kites and enjoy the summer breezes.\t\n2\tReturn to Hargold Hardbottle\tHargold Hardbottle can be found at the party tree in Hobbiton. You should speak with Hargold Hardbottle.\n",
[5393]="7000AE6A\n1\tExamine George\tGeorge is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. You should find out what is wrong with the rooster, George.\n2\tExamine George\tGeorge is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. You should check on the rooster, George.\n3\tTalk to Wald Sandson\tWald Sandson is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. You should return to Wald Sandson and report your success.\n",
[5394]="7000AF2C\n1\tTalk to George\tGeorge is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. You should speak with George.\n2\tTalk to Fox\030Talk to Wolf\030Talk to Fang\030Talk to Grip\030Talk to Old Sally\tThe fox is along the Stock road. Old Sally often wanders into the hills east of Tuckborough, east of Sandson's Farm. Fang, Grip, and Wolf patrol Bamfurlong, far to the east of Sandson's Farm and south along the Brandywine River. George has asked you to speak with the creatures of the Shire. You should seek out and speak with the fox, Old Sally, Fang, Grip, and Wolf in the Shire.\n",
[5395]="7000B3E7\n1\tTalk to Sniken\030Talk to Wink\030Talk to Grey Squirrel\030Talk to Horse\030Talk to Cow\tThe horse is at Hengstacer. The grey squirrel can be found on an island in the southern part of Nen Harn. Wink the cat may be found in Bree. Sniken can be found in the south-east part of the Midgewater Marshes, in Roderick Neeker-friend's camp, on a hill above the Goblinhole Ruins. The cow can be found in Newbury in Buckland. George has asked you to speak with the creatures of Bree-land. You should seek out and speak with the horse, the grey squirrel, Wink the cat, Sniken, and the cow in Bree-land.\n",
[5396]="7000B3E9\n1\tExamine George\tGeorge is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. You should find out what is wrong with the rooster, George.\n2\tExamine George\tGeorge is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. You should check on the rooster, George.\n",
[5397]="7000B3E6\n1\tTalk to Lynx-mother\tThe lynx-mother is at Thrasi's Lodge in Ered Luin, north of Celondim and Duillond. George has asked you to speak to the creatures of Ered Luin. You should seek out and speak with the lynx-mother.\n",
[5398]="7000B3EB\n1\tExamine George\tGeorge is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. You should find out what is wrong with the rooster, George.\n2\tExamine George\tGeorge is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. You should check on the rooster, George.\n",
[5399]="7000B3E5\n1\tTalk to Longbough\tGeorge has asked you to speak to the creatures of Evendim. You should seek out and speak with Longbough, the Ent in Evendim.\n",
[5400]="7000B3EC\n1\tExamine George\tGeorge is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. You should find out what is wrong with the rooster, George.\n2\tExamine George\tGeorge is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. You should check on the rooster, George.\n",
[5401]="7000B3E3\n1\tTalk to Radagast the Brown\tRadagast the Brown may be found in the tower at Ost Guruth. George has asked you to speak to the creatures of the Lone-lands. You should seek out and speak with Radagast the Brown in the Lone-lands.\n",
[5402]="7000B3ED\n1\tExamine George\tGeorge is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. You should find out what is wrong with the rooster, George.\n2\tExamine George\tGeorge is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. You should check on the rooster, George.\n",
[5403]="7000B3EE\n1\tExamine George\tGeorge is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. You should find out what is wrong with the rooster, George.\n2\tExamine George\tGeorge is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. You should check on the rooster, George.\n",
[5404]="7000B3FC\n1\tTalk to Aurochs Yearling\tThe aurochs yearling can be found amidst the small herd to the south-east of Gatson's farm. George has asked you to speak with the creatures of the North Downs. You should seek out and speak with the aurochs yearling in the North Downs.\n",
[5405]="7000B3E4\n1\tTalk to Roheryn\tRoheryn can be found at the stables in Rivendell. George has asked you to speak with the creatures of the Trollshaws. You should seek out and speak with Roheryn in the Trollshaws.\n",
[5406]="7000B3EF\n1\tExamine George\tGeorge is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. You should find out what is wrong with the rooster, George.\n2\tExamine George\tGeorge is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. You should check on the rooster, George.\n",
[5407]="70043DF2\n1\tCollect Orkish blades (total: 10)\tOrkish blades can be found on the Eastern side of Osgiliath. You should collect Orkish blades.\n2\tBring the Orkish swords to Edenos\tEdenos is at the Palace of Eldacar. You should bring the Orkish swords to Edenos.\n",
[5408]="7002FF76\n1\tScout the Orc-camp to the south-west of Walstow\tThe first Orc-camp can be found to the south of Walstow. Winsig has suggested that you investigate the path near the East Wall as well as the camp across the stream to the south.\n2\tScout the Orc-camp along the path to the East Wall\tThe second Orc-camp can be found to the north-west of Walstow. Winsig has suggested that you investigate the path near the East Wall as well as the camp across the stream to the south.\n3\tInvestigate the Rohirrim helm and attempt to find its owner\tThe Rohirrim helm lays on the ground near the pathway to the East Wall. You should examine the Rohirrim helm.\n4\tTalk to Winsig\tWinsig is in the Mead Hall of Walstow. You should return to Winsig with news of your discoveries.\n",
})
